INSERT INTO [dbo].[Manga] ([Id],[Name],[Description],[Level],[Status],[Type],[Countries],[Season],[MangaSeasonId],[UserId],[CreateDate],[IdUserCreate],[UpdateDate],[IdUserUpdate],[DeleteDate],[IdUserDelete]) VALUES (N'e265809b-a676-47fa-bdbb-b6da4e819aa6',N'Vagabond',N'In 16th-century Japan, Shinmen Takezou is a wild, rough young man in both his appearance and his actions. His aggressive nature has won him the collective reproach and fear of his village, leading him and his best friend, Matahachi Honiden, to run away in search of something grander than provincial life. The pair enlist in the Toyotomi army, yearning for glory—but when the Toyotomi suffer a crushing defeat at the hands of the Tokugawa Clan at the Battle of Sekigahara, the friends barely make it out alive.
