INSERT INTO [dbo].[Manga] ([Id],[Name],[Description],[Level],[Status],[Type],[Countries],[Season],[MangaSeasonId],[UserId],[CreateDate],[IdUserCreate],[UpdateDate],[IdUserUpdate],[DeleteDate],[IdUserDelete]) VALUES (N'bf3590cc-1419-4ff1-9d15-d492dd891fa6',N'Soul Eater',N'Death City is home to the Death Weapon Meister Academy, established by Shinigami—the grim reaper himself. Created to maintain peace, the academy trains Meisters and Demon Weapons—people who take on the form of a weapon—to defend humanity against evil. The ultimate goal of a Meister is to create a "Death Scythe" worthy of being wielded by Shinigami. To do this, their weapon partner must consume the souls of 99 wicked humans and one witch.
